readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A10	A10			0	eu	Is ${PRODUCTNAME} really free for any user?				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A11	A11			0	eu	${PRODUCTNAME} is free for use by everybody. You may take this copy of ${PRODUCTNAME} and install it on as many computers as you like, and use it for any purpose you like (including commercial, government, public administration and educational use). For further details see the license text delivered together with ${PRODUCTNAME} or <a href="https://www.openoffice.org/license.html">https://www.openoffice.org/license.html</a>				20200411 15:09:53
