helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVX_DLG_SHOWGRIDCOLUMNS:1\"\>In the \<emph\>Show Columns\</emph\> dialog you can select the columns to be shown. Hold down the Shift or Ctrl (Mac: Command) key to select multiple entries.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153561				0	eu	Denak				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504	87			0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_SHOWALLCOLS\"\>Zutabe guztiak erakusteko, egin klik \<emph\>Denak \</emph\>botoian.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153349				0	eu	Taula-kontrola teklatuaren bidez kontrolatu soilik				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149416				0	eu	If you use the keyboard only to travel through controls in your document, you will find one difference to the other types of controls: the Tab key does not move the cursor to the next control, but moves to the next column inside the table control. Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab to move to the next control, or press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab to move to the previous control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153062				0	eu	Taula-kontrolen teklatua soilik editatze modu berezian sartzeko:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	eu	Inprimaki-dokumentuak \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170500.xhp\" name=\"design mode\"\>diseinu modua\</link\>n egon behar du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	eu	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 to select the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	eu	Lehenengo kontrola hautatzeko sakatu Maius+F4. Taula-kontrola ez bada lehenengo kontrola, sakatu Tab hautatu arte.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	eu	Sakatu sartu, edizio modura sartzeko. Heldulekuak kontrol-ertza baino urrunago agertzen dira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	eu	Editatze moduan, editatze moduaren laster-menua ireki daiteke Maius+F10 sakatuz.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	eu	If you want to edit columns, press Shift+Space to enter column edit mode. Now you can rearrange the order of columns with \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Arrow keys. The Delete key deletes the current column.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	eu	Editatze modutik irteteko sakatu Tartea tekla.				20200411 15:09:53
