helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145762				0	eu	If you want to search for the actual characters ? or *, preface them with a backslash: "\\?" or "\\*". However, this is only necessary when \<emph\>Wildcard expression\</emph\> is enabled. When the option is not enabled, the wildcard characters are processed like normal characters.				20200411 15:09:53
