helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id0409200920593864				0	eu	Ikusgai				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200920593851				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Defines whether the control will be visible in live mode. In design mode, the control is always visible.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154683				0	eu	Note that if this property is set to "Yes" (the default), this does not necessarily mean the control will really appear on the screen. Additional constraints are applied when calculating a control's effective visibility. For instance, a control placed in a hidden section in Writer will never be visible at all, until at least the section itself becomes visible.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154691				0	eu	If the property is set to "No", then the control will always be hidden in live mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154614				0	eu	Older OpenOffice.org versions up to 3.1 will silently ignore this property when reading documents which make use of it.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12314				0	eu	Tamaina ikusgaia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12318				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>"balio-unitate"ean korritze-barrako kurtsorearen tamaina zehazten du. Adibidez, ("Geh. korritze-balioa"ren balioa ken "Gut. korritze-balioa") / 2 emaitza da: atzeko planoko arearen erdia hartzen duen korritze-barraren kurtsorea.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12375				0	eu	0n ezartzen bada, kurtsorearen zabalera eta altuera berdinak izango dira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12332				0	eu	Orientazioa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12336				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Korritze-barraren edo biratze-koadroaren orientazio horizontala edo bertikala zehazten du.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	eu	Aktibatze-ordena				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146959				0	eu	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Aktibatze-ordena\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150347	2			0	eu	\<variable id=\"text\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TabDialog\"\>\<emph\> Aktibazio-ordena\</emph\>elkarrizketa-koadroan kontrol-eremuek fokua hartzeko ordena alda daiteke erabiltzaileak tab tekla sakatutakoan.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	eu	Inprimaki-elementuak txertatzen badira dokumentu batean, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>(e)k automatikoki erabakitzen du kurtsorea zein ordenatan aldatuko den lekuz kontrol batetik bestera Tab tekla sakatzean. Gehitzen den kontrol berri bakoitza seriearen amaieran kokatuko da automatikoki. Seriearen ordena zure beharretara egoki dezakezu \<emph\>Aktibazio-ordena\</emph\>ren elkarrizketa-koadroan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	eu	Kontrol baten indizea ere defini dezakezu bere propietate berezien bidez, nahi dituzun balioak \<emph\>Propietateak\</emph\>elkarrizketa -koadroko \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Order\"\>\<emph\>Ordena\</emph\>\</link\> eremuan sartuz.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	eu	Aukera-botoi batera Tab teklaren bidez sar daiteke soilik, aukera-botoia "hautatua" dagoenean. Aukera-botoi talde bat diseinatu baduzu eta horietatik ez badago bat ere "hautatuta", ondoren erabiltzailea ezingo da sartu taldean edo aukera-botoiren batean teklatuaren bidez.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	eu	Kontrolak				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789	5			0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABORDER_CONTROLS\"\>Inprimakiko kontrol guztiak zerrendatzen ditu. Kontrol horiek hauta daitezke tab teklaren bidez ezarritako ordenan goitik behera.\</ahelp\> \<emph\>Kontrol-\</emph\>zerrendatik hautatu kontrol bat nahi duzun kokalekua esleitzeko aktibazio-ordenan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750				0	eu	Eraman gora				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	7			0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_UP\"\> Hautatutako kontrola aktibazio-ordenan maila bat igotzeko egin klik\<emph\> Eraman gora\</emph\> botoian.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	eu	Eraman beherantz				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823	9			0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_DOWN\"\>Hautatutako kontrola aktibazio-ordenan maila bat jaisteko, egin klik \<emph\> Eraman beherantz\</emph\> botoian.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154288				0	eu	Ordenatze automatikoa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	11			0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_AUTO_ORDER\"\>Kontrolak dokumentuan daukaten posizioaren arabera ordenatzeko, egin klik \<emph\> Ordenatze automatikoa\</emph\> botoian.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	eu	Grafiko modua				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149762				0	eu	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/24020000.xhp\" name=\"Graphics Mode\"\>Grafiko modua\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150255				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafMode\"\>Hautatutako grafiko-objekturako ikuspegi-atributuak zerrendatzen dira. Uneko fitxategian txertatu edo estekatutako grafiko-objektua ez da aldatuko, objektuaren ikuspegia bakarrik aldatuko da.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	eu	\<image id=\"img_id3154515\" src=\"res/helpimg/zellvor.png\" width=\"1.528in\" height=\"0.292in\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154515\"\>Cell Styles\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	eu	Grafiko modua				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155262				0	eu	Lehenetsia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	eu	Grafiko-objektuaren ikuspegia ez da aldatuko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	eu	Gris-eskala				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	eu	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also use the color sliders to apply a uniform color to the monochrome graphic object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	eu	Zuri-beltzean				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	eu	Grafiko-objektua zuri-beltzean erakusten da. %50eko distira-balioa baino txikiagoak beltzez agertuko dira eta %50 baino handiagoak zuriz.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795				0	eu	Ur-marka				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	eu	Grafiko-objektuaren distira berretu eta kontrastea murriztu egiten dira, atzeko planoan ur-marka gisa erabiltzeko. 				20200411 15:09:53
