helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	eu	Click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3610034\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3610034\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> toolbar. 				20200411 15:09:53
