helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3148919				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DID_SAVE_PACKED_XML\"\>Lehenespenez, OpenDocument fitxategi-formatuan kargatzen eta gordetzen ditu fitxategiak $[officename](e)k.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN10725				0	eu	The OpenDocument file format (ODF) is a standardized file format used by many software applications. You can find more information at the Wikipedia site: \<link href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenDocument\"\>wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenDocument\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
