helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\text_color.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	eu	\<image id=\"img_id3159233\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_color.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159233\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
