helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	eu	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. The \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page of the dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
