helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147399				0	eu	\<variable id=\"assistive\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/assistive.xhp\" name=\"Assistive Tools in $[officename]\"\>$[officename] aplikazioko tresna laguntzaileak\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	eu	$[officename] aplikazioak teknologia-tresna laguntzaile batzuk onartzen ditu, hala nola pantailako luparen softwarea, pantailako irakurleak eta pantailako teklatuak. Tresna horiek gehienak Java(TM) Access Bridge softwarearen bidez komunikatzen dira $[officename] aplikazioarekin. Software hori Java Accessibility APIk erabiltzen du, Java runtime environment-en zati bat.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id8847010				0	eu	A current list of supported assistive tools can be found on the \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Accessibility\"\>Apache OpenOffice Wiki\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145345				0	eu	$[officename] aplikazioan tresna laguntzaileak erabiltzeko eskakizunak				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	eu	Java Runtime Environment (JRE) 1.4.1_01 bertsioa eta berriagoa edo 1.4.0_02 bertsioa "en_us" ezarpen lokalarekin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	eu	Softwarearen bertsiorik berriena tresna laguntzailearentzat				20200411 15:09:53
