helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3139133				0	eu	Different methods exist to start a chart:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6772972				0	eu	Insert a chart based on data from cells in Calc or Writer.				20200411 15:09:53
