helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	hd_id3093440				0	eu	\<variable id=\"macro_recording\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/macro_recording.xhp\" name=\"Recording a Macro\"\>Makroak grabatzea\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	eu	Ireki makroa grabatu nahi diozun dokumentua.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	eu	Aukeratu \<emph\>Tresnak - Makroak - Grabatu makroa\</emph\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	eu	\<emph\>Grabatu makroa\</emph\> elkarrizketa-koadro txikia ikusiko duzu. \<emph\>Gelditu grabazioa\</emph\> botoia bakarrik dauka.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	eu	Egin dokumentuan grabatu nahi dituzun ekintzak.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	eu	Sakatu Ihes tekla objektu bat desautatzeko, makro-grabatzaileak oraindik ez baitu ekintza hori saguaren klikaren bidez grabatzen.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3148492				0	eu	Egin klik \<emph\>Gelditu grabazioa\</emph\> botoian.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3148686				0	eu	\<emph\>Makroa\</emph\> elkarrizketa-koadroa agertuko da, eta hor makroa gorde eta exekuta dezakezu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	eu	Grabazioa makroa gorde gabe abortatu nahi baduzu, egin klik \<emph\>Grabatu makroa\</emph\> elkarrizketa-koadroko \<emph\>Itxi\</emph\> botoian.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	eu	Makroa gordetzeko, hautatu objektua, non makroa gorde nahi duzun, \<emph\>Gorde makroa hemen\</emph\> zerrenda-koadroan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550	12			0	eu	Makroa liburutegi edo modulu berri batean gorde nahi baduzu, egin klik \<emph\>Liburutegi berria\</emph\> edo \<emph\>Modulu berria\</emph\> botoian eta idatzi liburutegiaren edo moduluaren izena.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	eu	Idatzi makro berriaren izena \<emph\>Makro-izena\</emph\> testu-koadroan. Ez erabili Basic gako-hitzak izen gisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	eu	Egin klik \<emph\>Gorde\</emph\> botoian.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	hd_id2486342				0	eu	Limitations of the macro recorder				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3608508				0	eu	The following actions are \<emph\>not\</emph\> recorded:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id921353				0	eu	Opening of windows is not recorded.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id9296243				0	eu	Actions carried out in another window than where the recorder was started are not recorded.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id4269234				0	eu	Window switching is not recorded.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id8014465				0	eu	Actions that are not related to the document contents are not recorded. For example, changes made in the Options dialog, macro organizer, customizing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id2814416				0	eu	Selections are recorded only if they are done by using the keyboard (cursor traveling), but not when the mouse is used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id2522354				0	eu	The macro recorder works only in Calc and Writer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	eu	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06130000.xhp\" name=\"Macro\"\>Makroa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	eu	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0600.xhp\" name=\"macro programming in $[officename]\"\>%PRODUCTNAME aplikazioan programatzea\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id7797242				0	eu	Makroa grabatzeko funtzionalitatea %PRODUCTNAME Writer testu-dokumentuetan eta %PRODUCTNAME Calc kalkulu-orrietan bakarrik dago erabilgarri.				20200411 15:09:53
