helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	eu	Beharrezkoa izanez gero, garbitu \<emph\>Bilatu\</emph\> testu-koadroa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	eu	Sakatu \<emph\>Atributuak\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
