helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	eu	Ezarpen hauek baliozkoak izango dira Microsoft OLE zerbitzaririk ez dagoenean (adibidez,UNIXen) edo $[officename] programaren OLE zerbitzaririk prest ez dagoenean OLE objektuak editatzeko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364795				0	eu	If an OLE server is active for the embedded object, then the OLE server will be used to handle the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364725				0	eu	If no OLE server is active for MathType objects, then embedded MathType objects can be converted to %PRODUCTNAME Math objects. For this conversion, the embedded MathType objects must not exceed the MathType 3.1 specifications.				20200411 15:09:53
