helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153988				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_CONTENT\"\> \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc-eko leiho nagusian zein elementu bistaratu behar diren definitzen du. Taulako balioen nabarmentzea erakuts edo ken daiteke.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
