helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153707	28			0	eu	         \<emph\>Example:\</emph\> Type the text 'Test' in cell A1; and the text 'test' in B1. Then type the formula "=A1=B1" in cell C1. If the \<emph\>Case sensitive\</emph\> box is marked, FALSE will appear in the cell; otherwise, TRUE will appear in the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	eu	EXACT testu-funtzioak beti bereizten ditu maiuskulak eta minuskulak, elkarrizketa-koadroaren ezarpenei jaramonik egin gabe.				20200411 15:09:53
