helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_BACKUP\"\>Dokumentuaren aurreko bertsioa gordetzen du babeskopia gisa, dokumentua gordetzen duzunean. \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME(e)k\</item\> babeskopia bat sortzen duen bakoitzean, aurreko babeskopia ordezten du. .BAK da babeskopiaren luzapena.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	eu	To change the location of the backup copy, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Paths\</emph\>, and then enter a new path for the backup file.				20200411 15:09:53
