helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149031				0	eu	Edozein karaktere bakar adierazten du lerro-jauzian edo paragrafo-jauzian izan ezik. Adibidez, "g.zi" bilaketa-terminoak "gezi" eta"gazi" hitzetarako balio du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	eu	^				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155351				0	eu	Bilaketa-terminoa bilatzeko ezinbestekoa da terminoa paragrafoaren hasieran egotea. Objektu bereziak, adibidez, eremu hutsak edo karaktereen marko bereziak paragrafoaren hasieran badaude, ez ikusi egingo zaie. Adibidea: "^Jon".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	eu	$				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152542				0	eu	Bilaketa-terminoa bilatzeko ezinbestekoa da terminoa paragrafoaren amaieran egotea. Objektu bereziak, adibidez, eremu hutsak edo karaktereen marko bereziak paragrafoaren amaieran badaude, ez ikusi egingo zaie. Adibidea: "Jon$".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	eu	*				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	eu	"*"-ren aurrean zero edo karaktere gehiago bilatzen ditu. Adibidez, "Ab*c"(e)k "Ac", "Abc", "Abbc", "Abbbc" eta abar bilatzen ditu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	eu	+				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	eu	"+"-ren aurrean karaktere bat edo gehiago bilatzen ditu. Adibidez, "AX.+4"(e)k "AXx4" bilatzen du baina ez "AX4".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	eu	Paragrafoan bilaketa-ereduarekin bat datorren katerik luzeena bilatzen da beti. Paragrafoan "AX 4 AX4" katea badago, pasarte osoa nabarmentzen da.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	eu	?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153684				0	eu	"?"-ren aurrean zero edo karaktere bat bilatzen du. Adibidez, "Testuak?"(e)k "Testua" eta "Testuak" bilatzen ditu eta "x(ab|c)?i"-(e)k "xy", "xabi" edo "xci" bilatzen ditu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	eu	\\				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	eu	"\\"(r)i jarraitzen dion karaktere berezia karaktere normal gisa interpretatzen du bilaketak eta ez adierazpen erregular gisa (\\n, \\t, \\>, eta \\< karaktereen konbinazioak izan ezik). Adibidez, "sor\\."(e)k "sor." bilatzen du eta ez "sortu" edo "sortzen".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152945				0	eu	\\n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153700				0	eu	Maius+Sartu tekla-konbinazioaren bidez txertatu den lerro-jauzia adierazten du. Paragrafo-jauzi bat lerro-jauzi bihurtzeko, idatzi \<emph\>\\n\</emph\> \<emph\>Bilatu\</emph\> eta \<emph\>Ordeztu\</emph\> koadroetan eta ondoren egin bilaketa bat eta ordezpen bat.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9262672				0	eu	\\n in the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> text box stands for a line break that was inserted with the Shift+Enter key combination.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id2366100				0	eu	\\n in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> text box stands for a paragraph break that can be entered with the Enter or Return key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153258				0	eu	\\t				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3157809				0	eu	Fitxa bat adierazten du. Adierazpen hau \<emph\>Ordeztu\</emph\> koadroan ere erabil daiteke.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670				0	eu	\\<				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153666				0	eu	 Hitz muga bat aurkitzeko. Adibidez, "\\bile"idatzita "iledun" aurkitzen da baina ez "artile", baina "ile\\b" jarrita, alderantziz, "artile" aurkitzen da eta ez "iledun". "ile" segida bakarrik jarriz gero bi terminoak aurkitzen dira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149576				0	eu	^$				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	eu	Paragrafo huts bat bilatzen du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	eu	^.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	eu	Paragrafoaren lehen karakterea aurkitzen du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147282				0	eu	& or $0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153961				0	eu	Ordezpen bat egiten denean, \<emph\>Ordeztu\</emph\> koadroko terminoan \<emph\>Bilatu\</emph\> koadroko bilaketa-irizpidearen bidez aurkitutako katea gehitzen du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149650				0	eu	Adibidez, "leihoa" idazten baduzu \<emph\>Bilatu\</emph\> koadroan eta "&markoa" \<emph\>Ordeztu\</emph\> koadroan, "leihoa" hitza "leiho-markoa" bihurtzen da.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	eu	Bilaketa-irizpideen bidez aurkitutako katearen \<emph\>Atributuak\</emph\> edo \<emph\>Formatua\</emph\> aldatzeko "&" ere \<emph\>Ordeztu\</emph\> koadroan sar daiteke.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	eu	[abc123]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154630				0	eu	Kortxeteen arteko karaktereetako bat adierazten du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156293				0	eu	[a-e]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167				0	eu	Represents any of the characters that are between a and e, including both start and end characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id100520090232005				0	eu	The characters are ordered by their code numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155994				0	eu	[a-eh-x]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148676				0	eu	a-e eta h-x arteko edozein karaktere adierazten du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145318				0	eu	[^a-s]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	eu	Represents everything that is not between a and s.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156543				0	eu	\\xXXXX				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	eu	Lau zenbakiko (XXXX) kode hamaseitarrean oinarritutako karaktere berezia adierazten du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	eu	Karaktere bereziaren kodea erabilitako letra-tipoaren araberakoa da. Kodeak ikus daitezke \<emph\>Txertatu - Karaktere berezia\</emph\>aukeratuz.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	eu	|				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	eu	Finds the terms that occur before the "|" and also finds the terms that occur after the "|". For example, "this|that" finds "this" and "that".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147376				0	eu	{2}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	eu	Defines the number of times that the character in front of the opening bracket occurs. For example, "tre{2}" finds and selects "tree".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151289				0	eu	{1,2}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317				0	eu	Defines the minimum and maximum number of times that the character in front of the opening bracket can occur. For example, "tre{1,2}" finds and selects "tre" and "tree".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id4870754				0	eu	{1,}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id843836				0	eu	Irekitze-kortxetearen aurretik dagoen karakterea gutxienez zenbat aldiz ager daitekeen definitzen du. Adibidez, "gor{2}a" idatzita "gorra", "gorrra" eta "gorrrra" aurkitzen du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148616				0	eu	( )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id2701803				0	eu	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153573				0	eu	Kortxete arteko karaktereak erreferentzia gisa definitzen ditu. "\\1", ikurrarekin izenda dezakezu lehen erreferentzia, "\\2"rekin bigarren erreferentzia, etab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156061				0	eu	Adibidez, testuan 13487889 zenbakia baduzu, (8)7\\1\\1 adierazpen erregularra idatzita, "8788" zenbakia aurkituko du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id2367931				0	eu	() ere erabil daiteke terminoak taldekatzeko, adibidez, "a(bc)?d" idatzita "ad" edo "abcd" aurkitzen du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9200109				0	eu	In the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id5766472				0	eu	Use $ (dollar) instead of \\ (backslash) to replace references. Use $0 to replace the whole found string.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154790				0	eu	[:alpha:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147397				0	eu	Represents an alphabetic character. Use [:alpha:]+ to find one or more of them.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885				0	eu	[:digit:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	eu	Represents a decimal digit. Use [:digit:]+ to find one or more of them.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153743				0	eu	[:alnum:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153281				0	eu	Karaktere alfanumeriko bat ([:alpha:] adierazten du eta [:digit:].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	eu	[:space:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150961				0	eu	Represents a space character (but not other whitespace characters).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150486				0	eu	[:print:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150872				0	eu	Karaktere inprimagarri bat adierazten du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	eu	[:cntrl:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	eu	Ez inprimatzeko karaktere bat adierazten du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	eu	[:lower:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145730				0	eu	Karaktere minuskulak adierazten ditu \<emph\>Maiuskula/Minuskula\</emph\> hautatuta badago \<emph\>Aukerak\</emph\> eremuan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	eu	[:upper:]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150092	231			0	eu	Represents an uppercase character if \<emph\>Match case\</emph\> is selected in \<emph\>Options.\</emph\>               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	hd_id5311441				0	eu	Adibideak				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id956834773				0	eu	e([:digit:])?    -- finds 'e' followed by zero or one digit. Note that currently all named character classes like [:digit:] must be enclosed in parentheses.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id952368773				0	eu	^([:digit:])$    -- finds lines or cells with exactly one digit.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9568773				0	eu	You can combine the search terms to form complex searches.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	hd_id71413				0	eu	To find three-digit numbers alone in a paragraph				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id2924283				0	eu	^[:digit:]{3}$				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id5781731				0	eu	^ means the match has to be at the start of a paragraph, 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id6942045				0	eu	[:digit:] matches any decimal digit, 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id4721823				0	eu	{3} means there must be exactly 3 copies of "digit", 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id5806756				0	eu	$ means the match must end a paragraph. 				20200411 15:09:53
