helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	eu	In text documents, you can choose to apply the AutoCorrect corrections while you type [T], or only when you modify existing text [M] with \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - Apply\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
