helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157320				0	eu	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>If you want, you can use the STAR_SPOOL_DIR environment variable to specify the directory where the Xprinter spoolfiles are saved. For example:\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
