helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C9				0	eu	To protect the recording state with a password, click \<emph\>Protect\</emph\> and enter a password. Other users of this document can apply their changes, but they cannot disable change recording without knowing the password.				20200411 15:09:53
