helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id7319864				0	eu	Ikuspegiaren diseinua				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3423871				0	eu	For text documents, you can set the view layout. Reduce the zoom factor to see the effects of different view layout settings.				20200411 15:09:53
