helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id5016327				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Converts to the PDF/A-1a format. This is defined as an electronic document file format for long term preservation. All fonts that were used in the source document will be embedded into the generated PDF file. PDF tags will be written.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
