helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id9449446				0	eu	Functions can be entered using a syntax as specified by the \<link href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenFormula\"\>OpenFormula\</link\> proposal.				20200411 15:09:53
