helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id8919339				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select two or more objects and click this icon to align the objects at the bottom margin of the area.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
