helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id9611499				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a horizontal line to the current area.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
