helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id7812433				0	eu	A Net chart displays data values as points connected by some lines, in a grid net that resembles a spider net or a radar tube display.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id3512375				0	eu	For each row of chart data, a radial is shown on which the data is plotted. All data values are shown with the same scale, so all data values should have about the same magnitude.				20200411 15:09:53
