helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147434				0	eu	Saretak				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	eu	\<variable id=\"gitter\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can divide the axes into sections by assigning gridlines to them. This allows you to get a better overview of the chart, especially if you are working with large charts.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The Y axis major grid is activated by default.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156286				0	eu	Sareta nagusia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154511				0	eu	Sareta nagusi gisa ezartzeko ardatza definitzen du.				20200411 15:09:53
