helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	tit				0	eu	Chart Wizard - Chart Elements				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id70802				0	eu	\<variable id=\"wiz_chart_elements\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_elements.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard - Chart Elements\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id8746604				0	eu	On this page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose the chart elements to be shown.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6437269				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a title for your chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id9469893				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a subtitle for your chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id130008				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the x-axis (horizontal).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id5821710				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the y-axis (vertical).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id2871791				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the z-axis. This option is only available for three-dimensional charts.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id7333597				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays a legend in your chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id9976195				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Positions the legend to the left of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id2507400				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Positions the legend to the top of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id216681				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Positions the legend to the right of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id7709585				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Positions the legend to the bottom of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id4309518				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the x-axis.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id206610				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the y-axis.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6917020				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the z-axis. This option is only available for three-dimensional charts.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id9969481				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the secondary x-axis. This option is only available for charts that support a secondary x-axis.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id816675				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the secondary y-axis. This option is only available for charts that support a secondary y-axis.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id4411145				0	eu	To enter chart elements				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id3274941				0	eu	Enter titles or click the elements that you want to be shown on the current chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id9804681				0	eu	Tituluak				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id3614917				0	eu	If you enter text for a title, subtitle, or any axis, the necessary space will be reserved to display the text next to the chart. If you do not enter a text, no space will be reserved, leaving more space to display the chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id156865				0	eu	It is not possible to link the title text to a cell. You must enter the text directly.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6034424				0	eu	When the chart is finished, you can change the position and other properties by the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id9033783				0	eu	Legenda				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id1069368				0	eu	The legend displays the labels from the first row or column, or from the range that you have set in the Data Series dialog. If your chart does not contain labels, the legend displays text like "Row 1, Row 2, ...", or "Column A, Column B, ..." according to the row number or column letter of the chart data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6998809				0	eu	You cannot enter the text directly, it is automatically generated from the Name cell range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id71413				0	eu	Select one of the position options. When the chart is finished, you can specify other positions using the Format menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id4776757				0	eu	Saretak				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6737876				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the x-axis.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id1058992				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the y-axis.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id7366557				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the z-axis. This option is only available for three-dimensional charts.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6527298				0	eu	The visible grid lines can help to estimate the data values in the chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id2924283				0	eu	The distance of the grid lines corresponds to the interval settings in the Scale tab of the axis properties.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id5781731				0	eu	Grid lines are not available for pie charts.				20200411 15:09:53
