helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\select_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159238				0	eu	To select an object that is covered by other objects, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click through the objects until you reach the underlying object. To cycle through the objects in reverse order, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift when you click.				20200411 15:09:53
