helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3154484				0	eu	Formulen ordez kalkulu-emaitzak esportatu nahi badituzu, ez hautatu \<emph\>Formulak\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3148702				0	eu	Aukeratu \<emph\>Fitxategia - Gorde honela\</emph\>. Aukeratu \<emph\>Fitxategia - Gorde honela\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3153912				0	eu	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File type\</item\> field select the format "Text CSV".				20200411 15:09:53
