helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3152869				0	eu	\<emph\>Testu-esportazioa\</emph\>ren elkarrizketa-koadroa irekitzen denean, hautatu esportatu behar diren datuen karaktere-jokoa eta eremu- eta testu-bereizleak. Ondoren, berretsi \<emph\>Ados\</emph\> botoian klik eginez.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3146781				0	eu	If the numbers use commas as decimal separators or thousands separators, do not select the comma as the field delimiter. If the text contains double quotation marks, you must select the single quotation mark as separator.				20200411 15:09:53
