helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id6531266				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If the current entry in the Settings listbox allows to edit a value, you can click the Edit button. A dialog opens where you can change the value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
