helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150949				0	eu	Hautatu kalkulu-orriko area karratu bat; adib. A1etik A5era.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3151260				0	eu	AREa desautatu gabe, hautatu MUNIT funtzioa. Hautatu \<emph\>Matrizea\</emph\> kontrol-laukia. Sartu matrize unitarioaren neurriak, kasu honetan \<item type=\"input\"\>5\</item\>, eta egin klik \<emph\>Ados\</emph\> botoian.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150403				0	eu	You can also enter the \<item type=\"input\"\>=Munit(5)\</item\> formula in the last cell of the selected range (E5), and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Shift+Command+Enter\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Shift+Ctrl+Enter\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3156143				0	eu	Orain A1:E5 area duen matrize unitarioa ikusiko duzu.				20200411 15:09:53
