helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3145569				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MINV\"\>Matrizearen alderantzizkoa ematen du.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156072				0	eu	Sintaxia				20200411 15:09:53
