helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Calculate\"\>Aldatutako formula guztiak birkalkulatzen ditu. 'Kalkulatu automatikoki' gaituta badago, Birkalkulatu komandoak RAND edo NOW bezalako formulei soilik aplikatuko zaie.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475899				0	eu	Sakatu F9 birkalkulatzeko. Sakatu Maius+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Komandoa\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ktrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 dokumentuaren formula guztiak birkalkulatzeko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	eu	Dokumentua birkalkulatu ondoren, pantaila freskatzen da. Diagrama guztiak ere freskatzen dira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475855				0	eu	The Add-In functions like RANDBETWEEN currently cannot respond to the Recalculate command or F9. Press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 to recalculate all formulas, including the Add-In functions.				20200411 15:09:53
