helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eomonth.xhp	0	help	par_id3156143				0	eu	\<item type=\"input\"\>=EOMONTH(DATE(2001;9;14);6)\</item\> returns the serial number 37346. Formatted as a date, this is 2002-03-31.				20200411 15:09:53
