helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147344				0	eu	Serie mota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257	15			0	eu	Seriearen mota definitzen du. Aukera hauek dituzu: \<emph\>Lineala, Geometrikoa, Data \</emph\>eta \<emph\>Bete automatikoki\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148488				0	eu	Lineala				20200411 15:09:53
