helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	eu	Emaitzaren leku dezimal \<emph\>ikusgaiak\</emph\> zehazteko aukeratu \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Hobespenak\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tresnak - Aukerak\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060500.xhp\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - Kalkulatu\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
