helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163671				0	eu	\<emph\>1 zenbakia-30 zenbakia\</emph\>: batura kalkulatzeko erabil daitezkeen 30 argumentu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163690				0	eu	Adibidea				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163704				0	eu	\<item type=\"input\"\>2\</item\>, \<item type=\"input\"\>3\</item\> eta \<item type=\"input\"\>4\</item\> zenbakiak sartzen badituzu 1. zenbakia, 2. zenbakia eta 3. zenbakiaren testu-koadroetan, 9 emango du emaitza gisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151740				0	eu	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM(A1;A3;B5)\</item\> formulak hiru gelaxken batura kalkulatzen du. \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM (A1:E10)\</item\> formulak A1 eta E10 arteko areako gelaxka guztien batura kalkulatzen du.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151756				0	eu	ETA (AND) eragilearen bidez lotutako baldintzak honela erabil daitezke SUM() funtzioarekin:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151774				0	eu	Adibidea: Demagun fakturak taula batean sartu dituzula. A zutabean fakturen datak sartu dituzu eta B zutabean zenbatekoak. Formula bat definitu nahi duzu, hilabete jakin bateko kopuru guztien totala eman dezan; adib. >=2008-01-01etik <2008-02-01era arteko aldiari bakarrik dagokion totala. Data-balioen area A1:A40 da eta totala kalkulatzeko erabiliko diren kopuruen area B1:B40. Erabiliko diren fakturen hasierako data (2008-\<item type=\"input\"\>01-01\</item\>) C1 gelaxkan dago eta azken data (2008-\<item type=\"input\"\>02-01\</item\>), berriz, C2 gelaxkan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151799				0	eu	Sartu formula hau matrize-formula gisa:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151813				0	eu	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM((A1:A40>=C1)*(A1:A40<C2)*B1:B40)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151828				0	eu	Hau matrize-formula gisa sartzeko, Maius\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>+Komandoa \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>+ Ktrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+ Sartu teklak sakatu behar dituzu, Sartu tekla sakatu beharrean, formula ixtean. Orduan formula giltza artean agertuko da \<emph\>Formula\</emph\>-barran.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151869				0	eu	{=SUM((A1:A40>=C1)*(A1:A40<C2)*B1:B40)}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151884				0	eu	Formularen oinarria hau da: irizpidea betetzen bada, konparazioaren emaitza 1 da, eta, betetzen ez bada, 0. Konparazio-emaitza bakoitza matrize gisa kudeatuko da, matrize-biderketan erabiliko da, eta, azkenik, balio indibidualen totala kalkulatuko da matrizearen emaitza emateko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151957				0	eu	\<bookmark_value\>SUMIF funtzioa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>batu;zehaztutako zenbakiak\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151957				0	eu	SUMIF				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151986				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMEWENN\"\>Irizpide jakin bat betetzen duten gelaxkak batzen ditu.\</ahelp\> Balio jakin baten bila area bat arakatzeko erabiltzen da funtzio hau.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152015				0	eu	Sintaxia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152028				0	eu	SUMIF(area; irizpideak; batuketa_area)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152043				0	eu	\<emph\>Area\</emph\>: irizpideak aplikatu behar zaizkion area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152062				0	eu	\<emph\>Irizpidea\</emph\>: bilaketa-irizpidea daukan gelaxka edo irizpidea bera. Komatxo bikoitzen artean idatzi behar da irizpidea formulan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152083				0	eu	\<emph\>Batuketa_area\</emph\>: batuko diren balioen area. Parametro hau ez bada adierazi, Arean aurkitutako balioak batuko dira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8347422				0	eu	SUMIF funtzioak erreferentziak konkatenatzeko eragilea (~) Irizpideen parametroan bakarrik onartzen du, eta SumRange aukerako parametroa ematen ez bada bakarrik.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152110				0	eu	Adibidea				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152148				0	eu	Zenbaki negatiboak bakarrik batzeko: \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(A1:A10;"<0")\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6670125				0	eu	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(A1:A10;">0";B1:10)\</item\> - B1:B10 areako balioen batuketa egiten du, soilik A1:A10 areako balioak >0 badira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6062196				0	eu	SUMIF() funtzioarekin erabil daitezkeen sintaxi-adibide gehiago ikusteko, ikus COUNTIF().				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151957K				0	eu	\<bookmark_value\>SUMIFS function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;specified numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151957K				0	eu	SUMIFS				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151986K				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMEWNRNG\"\>Sum the values of cells in a range that meet multiple criteria in multiple ranges.\</ahelp\> 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152015K				0	eu	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152028K				0	eu	SUMIFS( Reference R ; Reference R1 ; Criterion C1 [ ; Reference R2 ; Criterion C2 ]... )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152043K				0	eu	Sums the value of cells in range R that meet the Criterion C1 in the reference range R1, and the Criterion C2 in the reference range R2, and so on. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152062K				0	eu	A \<emph\>Criterion\</emph\> is a single cell Reference, Number or Text. If the criterion is written into the formula, it has to be surrounded by double quotes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152083K				0	eu	All \<emph\>Reference\</emph\> ranges shall have the same dimension and size, else an Error is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152110K				0	eu	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152148K				0	eu	Sum up cells in range A1:10 if the entries in B1:B10 are positive, and the entries in D1:D10 are the letter "A": \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIFS(A1:A10;B1:B10;">0";D1:D10;"A")\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6062196K				0	eu	See COUNTIFS() for some more syntax examples that can be used with SUMIFS().				20200411 15:09:53
