helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	eu	Select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Regular expressions\</item\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149843				0	eu	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Search for\</item\> box, type the search term and the wildcard(s) that you want to use in your search.				20200411 15:09:53
