helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150510				0	eu	Orrialde-estiloen zerrendan, egin klik eskuineko botoiaz "Eskuineko orrialdea" aukeran, eta aukeratu \<emph\>Aldatu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536				0	eu	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Styles\</item\> dialog, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Header\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
