helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	12			0	eu	Index entries are inserted as fields into your document. To view fields in your document, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View\</item\> and ensure that \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Field Shadings\</item\> is selected. 				20200411 15:09:53
