helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155898				0	eu	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select the paragraph style that you want to use for chapter titles, for example, "Heading 1".				20200411 15:09:53
