helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219				0	eu	Type "Chapter" followed by a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150245				0	eu	Enter a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>After\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
