helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3145643				0	eu	Jarri kurtsorea gelaxka batean edo hautatu gelaxkak. Egin klik eskuineko botoiaz laster-menua irekitzeko eta aukeratu \<emph\>Gelaxka - Babestu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3150042				0	eu	Babesa desaktibatzea				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	eu	Place the cursor in the cell or select the cells. First, if necessary, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\> and mark \<emph\>Cursor in protected areas - Enable\</emph\>. Then right-click the cell to open the context menu, choose \<emph\>Cell - Unprotect\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
