helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	eu	Egin klik \<emph\>Orrialde-estiloak\</emph\> ikonoan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10837				0	eu	Orrialde-estiloen zerrendan, egin klik eskuineko botoiaz elementuan eta aukeratu \<emph\>Berria\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083F				0	eu	\<emph\>Antolatzailea\</emph\> fitxan, idatzi orrialde-estiloaren izena \<emph\>Izena\</emph\> koadroan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1084B				0	eu	\<emph\>Hurrengo estiloa\</emph\> koadroan, hautatu hurrengo orrialdeari aplikatu nahi diozun orrialde-estiloa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10855				0	eu	To only apply the new page style to a single page, select "Default".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10859				0	eu	To apply the new page style to all subsequent pages, select the name of the new page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1085F				0	eu	Egin klik \<emph\>Atzeko planoa\</emph\> fitxan.				20200411 15:09:53
