helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id5009308				0	eu	To wrap text to the sides of a table, and to arrange two tables next to another, you must insert the tables into a frame. Click inside the table, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A twice to select the whole table, then choose \<emph\>Insert - Frame\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
