helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id111620090113399				0	eu	The words can be a mix of letters, numbers, and special characters. So the following text counts as four words: abc123 1.23 "$" http://www.example.com.				20200411 15:09:53
