helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642				0	eu	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File Name\</item\> box, type the name of the file that you want to insert, or click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and locate the file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968				0	eu	If the target text document contains sections, you can select the section that you want to insert in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sections\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
