helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155619				0	eu	\<variable id=\"conditional_text\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/conditional_text.xhp\" name=\"Conditional Text\"\>Baldintzapeko testua\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155879				0	eu	Zuk zehaztutako baldintza betetakoan testua bistaratzen duten eremuak konfigura ditzakezu dokumentuan. Adibidez, abisu-gutun batzuetan bistaratzen den baldintzapeko testua defini dezakezu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	eu	Adibide horretan, baldintzapeko testua konfiguratzea bi zati dituen prozesua da. Aurrena, aldagaia sortu behar duzu, eta ondoren, baldintza.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153175				0	eu	Baldintzapeko aldagai bat definitzea				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153185	62			0	eu	Adibidearen lehen zatian, baldintza-instrukzioarentzako aldagaia definitzen da.  				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155566				0	eu	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variables\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3147759				0	eu	Click "Set variable" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3147784				0	eu	Type a name for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box, for example \<item type=\"literal\"\>Reminder\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3147810				0	eu	Click "Text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id7748344				0	eu	Enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>1\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>.\<br/\>The Format list now displays a "General" format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145645				0	eu	Baldintza bat eta baldintzapeko testua definitzeko				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145659				0	eu	Adibidearen bigarren zatian, bete beharreko baldintza definitzen da, eta dokumentuan baldintzapeko testua bistaratzeko leku-marka txertatzen da.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3151193				0	eu	Kokatu kurtsorea baldintzapeko testua txertatzea nahi duzun lekuan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3151212				0	eu	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Functions\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3151250				0	eu	Click "Conditional text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155936				0	eu	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Reminder EQ "3"\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. In other words, the conditional text will be displayed when the variable in the field that you defined in the first part of this example is equal to three.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155969				0	eu	"3" biltzen duten komatxoek adierazten dute adibidearen lehen zatian definitu duzun aldagaia testu-katea dela.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150446				0	eu	Idatzi \<emph\>Orduan\</emph\> koadroko baldintza betetakoan bistaratzea nahi duzun testua. Sar dezakezun testuak ia ez du mugarik luzerari dagokionez. Koadro horretan paragrafo bat itsats dezakezu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150473				0	eu	Egin klik \<emph\>Txertatu\</emph\> botoian, eta ondoren \<emph\>Itxi\</emph\> botoian.				20200411 15:09:53
