helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	eu	Replace the number in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box with 3, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
