helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147692				0	eu	\<bookmark_value\>itsastea;formulen emaitzak\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>arbela;testuan kalkulatzea\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formulak;emaitzak testu-dokumentuetan itsastea\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147692				0	eu	\<variable id=\"calculate_clipboard\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_clipboard.xhp\" name=\" Calculating and Pasting the Result of a Formula in a Text Document\"\> Formulen emaitzak testu-dokumentuan kalkulatzea eta itsastea\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156366				0	eu	Testuak dagoeneko formula baldin badu, adibidez, "12+24*2", $[officename] aplikazioak formula kalkula dezakezu, eta ondoren, emaitza dokumentuan itsasten du, \<emph\>Formula-barra\</emph\> erabili gabe.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	eu	Hautatu formula testuan. Formulak zenbakiak eta eragileak bakarrik eduki ditzakezu, eta ezin du tarterik eduki.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155496	38			0	eu	Aukeratu \<emph\>Tresnak - Kalkulatu\</emph\>, edo sakatu \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ktrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Plus ikurra (+).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id5172582				0	eu	Place the cursor where you want to insert the result of the formula, and then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Paste\</item\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V.\<br/\>The selected formula is replaced by the result.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	tit				0	eu	Oin-oharrak edo amaiera-oharrak txertatzea eta editatzea				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145819				0	eu	\<bookmark_value\>amaiera-oharrak;txertatzea eta editatzea\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>txertatzea;oin-oharrak/amaiera-oharrak\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>ezabatzea;oin-oharrak\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editatzea;oin-oharrak/amaiera-oharrak\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>antolatzea;oin-oharrak\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>oin-oharrak; txertatzea eta editatzea\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145819				0	eu	\<variable id=\"footnote_usage\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footnote_usage.xhp\" name=\"Inserting and Editing Footnotes or Endnotes\"\>Oin-oharrak edo amaiera-oharrak txertatzea eta editatzea\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	eu	Oin-oharrek gai bati buruzko informazio gehiago ematen dute orrialdearen beheko aldean, eta amaiera-oharrek dokumentuaren amaieran. $[officename] aplikazioak automatikoki zenbakitzen ditu oin-oharrak eta amaiera-oharrak. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155881				0	eu	Oin-oharra edo amaiera-oharra txertatzeko				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155903				0	eu	Egin klik dokumentuan, oharraren aingura kokatzea nahi duzun lekuan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147120				0	eu	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Footnote/Endnote\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150937				0	eu	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> area, select the format that you want to use. If you select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Character\</item\>, click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and select the character that you want to use for the footnote.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	eu	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Footnote\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Endnote\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150704				0	eu	Sakatu \<emph\>Ados\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150729				0	eu	Idatzi oharra.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3148843				0	eu	\<image id=\"img_id3148857\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertfootnote.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148857\"\>Ikonoa\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153176				0	eu	Oin-oharra sartzeko, \<emph\>Txertatu\</emph\> tresna-barrako \<emph\>Txertatu oin-oharra zuzenean\</emph\> ikonoan klik egin dezakezu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155543				0	eu	Oin-oharra edo amaiera-oharra editatzeko				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150167				0	eu	Saguaren erakuslea esku bihurtzen da dokumentuko oin-oharraren edo amaiera-oharraren ainguran kokatzean.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155563				0	eu	Oin-oharren edo amaiera-oharren testua editatzeko, egin klik oharrean edo egin klik oharraren ainguran, testuan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145029				0	eu	To change the format of a footnote, click in the footnote, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the Styles and Formatting window, right-click "Footnote" in the list, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145062				0	eu	Oin-oharraren edo amaiera-oharraren testutik testuko ohar-aingurara joateko, sakatu OrrGor.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145081				0	eu	To edit the numbering properties of a footnote or endnote anchor, click in front of the anchor, and choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Footnote/Endnote\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	eu	To change the formatting that $[officename] applies to footnotes and endnotes, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Footnotes\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Footnotes/Endnotes\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147813				0	eu	Oin-oharren edo amaiera-oharren testu-arearen propietateak editatzeko, aukeratu \<emph\>Formatua - Orrialdea\</emph\>, eta egin klik \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040600.xhp\" name=\"Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Oin-oharra\</emph\>\</link\> fitxan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147232				0	eu	Oin-oharra kentzeko, ezabatu oin-oharraren aingura testuan.				20200411 15:09:53
