helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147765				0	eu	Select the options that you want, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>. If you want, you can also enter different text in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Category\</item\> box, for example \<item type=\"literal\"\>Figure\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
