helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147271				0	eu	A caption is formatted with the paragraph style that matches the name of the caption category. For example, if you insert a "Table" caption, the "Table" paragraph style is applied to the caption text.				20200411 15:09:53
