helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480				0	eu	\<variable id=\"bereich\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"FN_INSERT_COLUMN_SECTION\"\>Kurtsorea dagoen lekuan testu-sekzioa txertatzen du. Horren ordez, testu-bloke bat hautatu eta komando hori aukera dezakezu sekzioa sortzeko. Sekzioak erabil ditzakezu beste dokumentu batzuetako testu-blokeak txertatzeko, zutabe-diseinu pertsonalizatuak aplikatzeko edo testu-blokeak babesteko edo ezkutatzeko baldintza bat betetzen bada.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152955				0	eu	Sekzio batean dokumentu osoa edo beste dokumentu bateko sekzio bat txerta dezakezu.  Sekzioa \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#dde\" name=\"DDE\"\>DDE\</link\> esteka gisa ere txerta dezakezu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149684				0	eu	Sekzio bat editatzeko, aukeratu \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02170000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sections\"\>\<emph\>Formatua - Sekzioak\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155183	6			0	eu	\<emph\>Txertatu sekzioa\</emph\> elkarrizketa-koadroak fitxa hauek ditu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151257				0	eu	Txertatu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149102				0	eu	Zehaztutako sekzioa kurtsorea dagoen lekuan txertatzen du dokumentuan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	eu	Hitz-zatiketa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154657				0	eu	Hitz-zatiketa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148572				0	eu	\<variable id=\"silben\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts hyphens in words that are too long to fit at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> $[officename] searches the document and suggests hyphenation that you can accept or reject. If text is selected, the Hyphenation dialog works on the selected text only. If no text is selected, the Hyphenation dialog works on the whole document.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	eu	To automatically hyphenate the current or selected paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030200.xhp\" name=\"Text Flow\"\>Text Flow\</link\> tab. You can also apply automatic hyphenation to a paragraph style. In text where automatic hyphenation is enabled, the Hyphenation dialog will not find any word to hyphenate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151389				0	eu	$[officename] aplikazioak marratxoa behar duen hitza aurkitzen duenean, hautatuta aukera hauetako bat:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155622				0	eu	Bistaratutako hitzaren hipenazioa onartzeko, egin klik \<emph\>Zatitu\</emph\> botoian.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154558				0	eu	Bistaratutako hitzaren zatiketa aldatzeko, egin klik hitzaren azpian dagoen ezker edo eskuineko gezian, eta ondoren egin klik \<emph\>Zatitu\</emph\>n. Ezker eta eskuineko botoiak gaitzen dira hainbat hipenazio-puntu dituzten hitzentzako.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150017				0	eu	Bistaratutako hitzaren hipenazioa ukatzeko, egin klik \<emph\>Saltatu\</emph\> botoian. Hitza ez da zatituko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150018				0	eu	To automatically hyphenate the remaining part of the selection or the document, click \<emph\>Hyphenate All\</emph\> and answer "Yes" to the following question.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150019				0	eu	Hitz-zatiketa amaitzeko, egin klik \<emph\>Itxi\</emph\> botoian. Aplikatutako hitz-zatiketa ez da leheneratuko. \<emph\>Editatu - Desegin\</emph\> erabil dezakezu hitz-zatiketa desegiteko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147562				0	eu	Hitz-zatiketa automatikotik paragrafoak baztertzeko, hautatu paragrafoak, aukeratu \<emph\>Formatua - Paragrafoa\</emph\>, gero egin klik Testu-fluxua fitxan, eta ondoren garbitu  \<emph\>Automatikoki\</emph\> kontrol-laukia Hitz-zatiketaren arean.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154276				0	eu	To disable the Hyphenation dialog and always hyphenate automatically, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010400.xhp\" name=\"Language Settings - Writing Aids\"\>Language Settings - Writing Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and select the \<emph\>Hyphenate without inquiry\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152950				0	eu	To manually enter a hyphen directly in the document, click in the word where you want to add the hyphen, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Minus sign (-).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147523				0	eu	To insert a non-breaking (protected) hyphen directly in the document, click in the word that you want to hyphenate, and then press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>+Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Minus sign(-).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154573				0	eu	To hide custom hyphens, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and then clear the \<emph\>Custom hyphens\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150360				0	eu	Hitza				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153676				0	eu	Hitza				20200411 15:09:53
