helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150764				0	eu	Aldagai-eremuen bidez eduki dinamikoa gehi dezakezu dokumentuetan. Adibidez, aldagai bat erabil dezakezu orrialde-zenbakitzea berrezartzeko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149759				0	eu	Erabiltzaileak definitutako eremuak uneko dokumentuan bakarrik daude erabilgarri.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802243625				0	eu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150703				0	eu	Mota				20200411 15:09:53
